---
import Container from '../atoms/Container.astro';
import Icon from '../atoms/Icon.astro';
---

<section id="problem" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
  <Container>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <span
        class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-mentor-deep-turquoise bg-mentor-ice rounded-full"
      >
        The Academic Challenge
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-mentor-night mb-4">
        Academic Help Shouldn't Be Disorganized or Inaccessible
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        University students often encounter steep learning curves in advanced coursework, yet existing ways to seek guidance fall short.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Problem 1: Expensive External Tutoring -->
      <div class="flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 transition-all">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100/70 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <Icon name="clock" class="w-6 h-6" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-mentor-night mb-3">
          Expensive Commercial Alternatives
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Traditional private tutoring services and external academies charge high rates that are difficult for university students to afford, creating an unnecessary barrier to academic recovery and success.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Problem 2: Informal, Chaotic Chat Groups -->
      <div class="flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 transition-all">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100/70 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <Icon name="user-group" class="w-6 h-6" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-mentor-night mb-3">
          Informal and Disconnected Chats
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Students frequently resort to unstructured messaging groups to ask for help. Requests get buried in chat feeds, commitments are often missed, and there is no reliable way to verify tutor knowledge or schedule.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mentor Solution Bridge -->
    <div class="mt-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-route/10 border border-mentor-turquoise/30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-mentor-turquoise/20 text-mentor-deep-turquoise flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <Icon name="check" class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-heading font-semibold text-mentor-night text-sm">
            Mentor organizes peer support in one verified campus platform
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
            Structured requests, verified UCE student accounts, and dedicated session completion codes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
